    IDS_HELLO_LEAD          "Nāku i hanga a Lang Switcher, ā, e koa ana ahau i whakauru koe i a ia. Kotahi anake te mahi a te hōtaka: ka whakatika i te kupu i tuhia ki te whakatakotoranga hē. Anei tōna āhua:"
    IDS_HELLO_DEMO_CAP      "I tuhi koe i “фкщрф”, ka pēhi i a {0}, ā, ka whiwhi koe ki “aroha”, ka whakawhiti te whakatakotoranga ki te reo Māori. Pēhia anō, ka hoki ki tōna āhua o mua."
    IDS_HELLO_PANEL         "E toru ngā mea mō te rā tuatahi"
    IDS_HELLO_ROW_1         "Ka whakahurihia e {0} te kupu whakamutunga i tuhia, ka whakawhiti hoki i te whakatakotoranga. E mahi ana i ia matapihi."
    IDS_HELLO_ROW_2         "Pēhia anō {0}, ka hoki te kupu ki tōna āhua o mua, pū ki te pū."
    IDS_HELLO_ROW_3         "Te tohu i te wāhi whakamōhiotanga: te whakatā, ngā tautuhinga me “Mō te hōtaka”, he wāhanga “Me pēhea te whakamahi” kei roto."
    IDS_HELLO_SETTINGS      "Whakatuwhera i ngā tautuhinga"
    IDS_HELLO_OK            "Kua mārama"
    IDS_THANKS_TITLE        "Kua pahure he marama. Ngā mihi!"
    IDS_THANKS_LEAD         "Kia ora, ko Panda anō tēnei. Kotahi marama ki muri i whakauru koe i a Lang Switcher, ā, e tūmanako ana ahau e pai ana ki a koe: he nui taku mahi kia māmā, kia mahi noa hoki te hōtaka."
    IDS_THANKS_PARA         "Mēnā i pai ki a koe, kōrero mai i GitHub Issues. Mēnā he hē tētahi mea, tuhia mai ki ahau: he mea nui hoki te whakahē — kia mōhio rā anō tētahi ki te raruraru, kātahi ka taea te whakatika. Kei te rārangi kōwhiri o te tohu te kaiārahi, i raro i “Tuhi ki te kaituhi…”."
    IDS_SUPPORT_PANEL       "Tautoko i te kaituhi"
    IDS_SUPPORT_TEXT        "He koreutu te hōtaka, ā, ka pērā tonu. Mēnā e hiahia ana koe ki te whakawhetai mā te mahi, kei te whārangi tautoko ētahi huarahi. He pai kei te whakanui koe i te mahi a tētahi atu ♥"
    IDS_THANKS_SNOOZE       "Whakamahara mai ā tērā wiki"
    IDS_THANKS_FOOT         "Kotahi anake te whakaatu i tēnei reta."
    IDS_WHATSNEW_TITLE      "Ngā mea hou i te putanga {0}"
    IDS_WHATSNEW_FROM       "{0} i a koe · kua whakahoutia i tēnei rā"
    IDS_WHATSNEW_TODAY      "kua whakahoutia i tēnei rā"
    IDS_WHATSNEW_PANEL      "E toru ngā panoni"
    IDS_WHATSNEW_1          "E kōrero marama ana te papa “Tūnga”: e mahi ana / kua whakatāhia / kāore i whakaurua te kapo kī / me tīmata anō te hōtaka — ā, e whakaatu ana i te takirua whakatakotoranga e whakamahia ana me ngā hē i te kōwhiri whakatakotoranga."
    IDS_WHATSNEW_2          "Ka tuhi te pātene “Tiaki i te pūkete…” i te pūkete ināianei; kei tōna upoko te wā i tangohia ai, me te kōrero mēnā kei te haere tonu te takiurunga."
    IDS_WHATSNEW_3          "Kua pono ake te pūkete: kāore te tuhi i hē e whakakino i te kōnae o mua, ka mahi inamata te pouaka “Pupuri pūkete” i tēnei takiurunga, ā, e kī ana te rārangi hina “Haere tonu” he aha i hina ai."
    IDS_WHATSNEW_FULL       "Kua whakaputaina te rārangi katoa o ngā panoni ki te hongere."
    IDS_AUTHOR_CAPTION      "Nā te kaituhi"
    IDS_AUTHOR_PANEL        "Te kaituhi"
    IDS_AUTHOR_TEXT         "Kotahi anake te tangata nāna te hōtaka i hanga i tōna wā wātea. He koreutu, ā, ka pērā tonu. Mēnā e hiahia ana koe ki te whakawhetai mā te mahi, kei te whārangi tautoko ētahi huarahi. He pai kei te whakanui koe i te mahi a tētahi atu ♥"
    IDS_NEWS_PANEL          "Ngā pūrongo me ngā whakahou"
    IDS_NEWS_ABOUT_FEED     "Kotahi te wā i ia rā ka pānui te hōtaka i tētahi kōnae pūrongo mai i te pae tukutuku a te kaituhi, ā, kāore e tukuna he kōrero mōu. Ka tikiake i ngā putanga hou mai i reira, ā, ka whakauru i aua putanga mā ia anō i muri i te arotake i te waitohu."
    IDS_NEWS_NEVER_READ     "Kāore anō te kōnae pūrongo kia pānuitia."
